    Parts : Hxc Reminder Template Fields, Hxc Reminder Mapping Layout, Hxc Reminder Storage
    Button : Hxc Fetch Template Btn, Form Accept, Form Cancel
    On : Form Destroy : Yes : CALL : Hxc Close Reminder Template
